- op: discuss  # 6992
  at: '2026-04-08T22:24:29Z'  # 6992
  by: agent  # 6992
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6992
  clock: 3  # 6992
  nonce: '6992'  # 6992
  message: "Concrete violations enumerated above are a snapshot through 2026-04-07 (~9156 entries). Subsequent drift through 2026-04-08: commit 7310783e1 modified .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py (added log_injection_history() writer, bumped TRANSCRIPT_DEDUP_TOKENS 50000->100000, regenerated PLAYBOOKS registry summary 14->19); commit 9ac06cc88 modified the same file again to add per-session DEST/PID isolation and remove the legacy global session-token mechanism. Both add new infra-SHA boundaries with no per-entry cohort markers, extending the unlabelled cohort window. Also corrected the on_transcript_change.py file path throughout description and root_cause: the file lives at .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py — verified 2026-04-08 via Glob, no other on_transcript_change.py exists in the repo. Status remains violated."  # 6992
