- op: discuss  # 4f6a
  at: '2026-04-08T22:40:24Z'  # 4f6a
  by: agent  # 4f6a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 4f6a
  clock: 6  # 4f6a
  nonce: 4f6a  # 4f6a
  message: "REVERT NOTE: the description above is the ORIGINAL pre-update text. It still contains stale references to 'on_transcript_change.py' (no directory). The actual file lives at .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py — verified 2026-04-08 via Glob, no other on_transcript_change.py exists in the repo. The fields.root_cause field above HAS been updated to the corrected path. The description was NOT updated because both attempts to do so pushed its serialized YAML representation over the 4096-byte ruamel.yaml fold threshold, triggering a tracker .ops YAML serializer bug (store.py:289 width=4096 vs unconditional nonce post-processor at store.py:298-303) that injected the per-line nonce comment into the scalar's continuation line, embedding garbage text into the description string on read-back. This bug fires for any description longer than ~4080 bytes after YAML overhead. A separate tracker item should be filed for the serializer fix; until then, treat 4080 bytes as the maximum safe description length."  # 4f6a
